# Local overrides for EVerest UI webserver configuration.
# Distribution defaults: @EVEREST_UI_INSTALL_FRONTEND_DEFAULTS@
# Only keys written here override defaults. Updates must preserve this file.
# Remove a local directive to inherit its distribution default again.
# key= sets an explicitly empty value; !key removes an inherited key.
# Required settings must still have valid values after merging.
# Relative root/auth_file paths resolve relative to the file supplying them.
# Examples (uncomment only the settings you want to override):
# port=8080
# app_title=My charging station
# allow_origin=
